units          metal
atom_style     atomic
newton         on
boundary       p p f

read_data      /projects/westgroup/akinyemi.az/mace_lammps/MHI_Nickel/calculation/adsorption/phase1_h2/structures/slab_h2_s_1.lammps
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (12.631872 15.158246 52.690537)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  362 atoms
  read_data CPU = 0.009 seconds

pair_style     mliap unified /projects/westgroup/akinyemi.az/mace_lammps/models/mace-mh-1.model-mliap_lammps.pt 0
pair_coeff     * * Al B C Cr Fe Mo Ni H

neighbor       2.0 bin
neigh_modify   every 1 delay 0 check yes

# ── Freeze bottom layers (z ≤ 22.115 Å) ─────────────────────────────
region         frozen_reg   block  INF INF  INF INF  EDGE  22.115
group          frozen_atoms region frozen_reg
129 atoms in group frozen_atoms
group          free_atoms   subtract all frozen_atoms
233 atoms in group free_atoms

fix            freeze  frozen_atoms  setforce  0.0  0.0  0.0

thermo         100
thermo_style   custom  step  pe  fmax  fnorm  press

print "### Adsorbate minimization ###"
### Adsorbate minimization ###

minimize       0.0  1e-06  10000  100000

